      "omegaBannerUrl": "",
      "readmeExcerpt": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n# 🛠️ CreateXIV [![CreateXIV Downloads Count](https://img.shields.io/badge/dynamic/json?url=https%3A%2F%2Fkamori.goats.dev%2FPlugin%2FDownloadCounts&query=%24.CreateXIV&label=&style=plastic&color=gold)](https://kamori.goats.dev/Plugin/DownloadCounts)[![Downloads](https://img.shields.io/badge/-Downloads-lightgrey?style=plastic)](https://kamori.goats.dev/Plugin/DownloadCounts)\n\n### Create custom slash commands with ease.\n\n[![Verified Plugin - Dalamud](https://img.shields.io/badge/✔%20Verified%20Plugin-Dalamud-red?style=for-the-badge)](#)\n[![Discord](https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Bryer-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white)](https://discordapp.com/users/896449611168874507)\n[![AGPL-3.0 License](https://img.shields.io/badge/⚖️%20License-AGPL--3.0-636e72?style=for-the-badge)](https://github.com/seventity7/CreateXIV?tab=AGPL-3.0-1-ov-file)\n\nCreateXIV is a Dalamud plugin for that allows players to create custom slash commands with ease.\nIt combines the flexibility of macros with the power of plugin commands, all through a clean in-game interface.\n\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n### 📌 Summary\n\n[![Features](https://img.shields.io/badge/✨%20Features-View-00b894?style=flat-square)](#features)\n[![Installation](https://img.shields.io/badge/🔧%20Installation-Guide-0984e3?style=flat-square)](#installation)\n[![How It Works](https://img.shields.io/badge/🧠%20How%20It%20Works-Read-6c5ce7?style=flat-square)](#how-it-works)\n[![Important Rules](https://img.shields.io/badge/⚠️%20Important%20Rules-Check-d63031?style=flat-square)](#important-rules)\n[![Future Plans](https://img.shields.io/badge/🚀%20Future%20Plans-Roadmap-fdcb6e?style=flat-square)](#future-plans)\n[![Author](https://img.shields.io/badge/👩‍💻%20Author-Bryer-00cec9?style=flat-square)](#author)\n[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/⚖️%20License-Info-636e72?style=flat-square)](#license)\n\n---\n\n</div>\n\n<a id=\"features\"></a>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n### ✨ Features\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td width=\"40%\">\n      <div align=\"center\"><h3>📝 Alias Creation</h3></div>\n      <p>Create custom slash command aliases and execute them directly through the in-game chat.</p>\n        <p>While creating commands/macros alias, you can create (or use existing) categories for them with it own color.</p>\n        <p>\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Macros/Shared-✔-gold?style=flat-square\" />\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Native%20Commands-✔-gold?style=flat-square\" />\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Plugin%20Commands-✔-gold?style=flat-square\" />\n      </p>\n    </td>\n    <td width=\"40%\">\n      <div align=\"center\"><h3>🫂 Support</h3></div>\n      <p>Use aliases for personal macros, shared macros, plugin commands and native game commands.</p>\n        <p>Example: Alias <code>/mv</code> Command: <code>/mastervolume</code> = <code>/mv</code> executes <code>/mastervolume</code></p>\n        <p>\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Macro%20Chains-✘-red?style=flat-square\" />\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Command%20Chains-✘-red?style=flat-square\" />\n      </p>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td width=\"40%\">\n      <div align=\"center\"><h3>🧩 Organization</h3></div>\n      <p>Keep aliases clean with favorites, categories, filters, search and import/export tools.</p>\n      <p>\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Help%20System-✔-brightgreen?style=flat-square\" />\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Automatic%20Saving-✔-brightgreen?style=flat-square\" />\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Categories-✔-brightgreen?style=flat-square\" />\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Favorites-✔-brightgreen?style=flat-square\" />\n      </p>\n    </td>\n    <td width=\"40%\">\n     <div align=\"center\"><h3>🖥️ In-Game UI</h3></div>\n      <p>Manage everything ingame using the plugin window opened with <code>/create</code>.</p>\n      <p>\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Panel%20List-✔-cyan?style=flat-square\" />\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Help%20Tooltips-✔-cyan?style=flat-square\" />\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Filters-✔-cyan?style=flat-square\" />\n      </p>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n### Supported/Available\n\n![Plugin Commands](https://img.shields.io/badge/Plugin%20Commands-✔-brightgreen?style=flat-square)\n![Game Commands](https://img.shields.io/badge/Game%20Commands-✔-brightgreen?style=flat-square)\n![Command Chain](https://img.shields.io/badge/Command%20Chain-✘-red?style=flat-square)\n![Game Macros](https://img.shields.io/badge/Macro%20Aliases-✔-brightgreen?style=flat-square)\n![Shared Macros](https://img.shields.io/badge/Shared%20Macros-✔-brightgreen?style=flat-square)\n![Macro Chain](https://img.shields.io/badge/Macro%20Chain-✘-red?style=flat-square)\n![Import/Export](https://img.shields.io/badge/Import%20%2F%20Export-✔-brightgreen?style=flat-square)\n![Enable/Disable](https://img.shields.io/badge/Enable%20%2F%20Disable-✔-brightgreen?style=flat-square)\n![Create through chat](https://img.shields.io/badge/Create%20Via%20Chat-✔-brightgreen?style=flat-square)\n![Command List](https://img.shields.io/badge/Command%20List-✔-brightgreen?style=flat-square)\n![Delay](https://img.shields.io/badge/Delay-✔-brightgreen?style=flat-square)\n![Mass Actions](https://img.shields.io/badge/Mass%20Actions-✘-red?style=flat-square)\n![Edit](https://img.shields.io/badge/Edit-✔-brightgreen?style=flat-square)\n\n</div>\n\n---\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<a id=\"installation\"></a>\n\n### 🔧 Dalamud Installation\n\n| Step | Action |\n| --- | --- |\n| 1️⃣ | Open the Dalamud plugin list with `/xlplugins` |\n| 2️⃣ | Search for `CreateXIV` |\n| 3️⃣ | Click **Install** |\n| 4️⃣ | Enable the plugin |\n| ✔ | Open the main window or type `/create` |\n\n</div>\n\n> [!TIP]\n> CreateXIV is intended to be installed through the ingame Dalamud plugin installer only.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"how-it-works\"></a>\n\n### 🧠 How It Works\n\n### 🪟 Main Window\n\n<img width=\"1094\" height=\"585\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2cfe5d5-f1ab-43e1-b64b-34147684b315\" />\n\nCreateXIV allows you to define aliases that point to commands or macros.\n\n---\n\n### 🔹 Alias → Command\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> Use this when you want a shorter custom command to execute a longer command.\n\n**Example:**\n| Alias | Command |\n| --- | --- |\n| `Golem` | `/Example Dynamis Golem` |\n\nTyping this in chat:\n```txt\n/Golem\n```\n\nExecutes:\n```txt\n/Example Dynamis Golem\n```\n\n---\n\n### 🔹 Alias → Macro\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> Use this when you want an alias to execute a macro from your in-game macro list.\n\n**Example:**\n| Alias | Macro |\n| --- | --- |\n| `Golem` | `macro:45` |\n\nTyping this in chat:\n```txt\n/Golem\n```\n\nExecutes:\n```txt\nMacro 45\n```\n\n---\n\n### 🔹 Categories/Favorites\n\nWhile creating command or macro aliases, you can create new categories or use existing ones. Categories can have their own color.\nYou can also pin/favorite an alias to keep it at the top of the list.\n\n<img width=\"655\" height=\"205\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/79adacad-16a3-4d41-b560-11a7dae1db2f\" />\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"important-rules\"></a>\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n### ⚠️ Important Rules\n\n| Rule | Status |\n| --- | --- |\n| Do **not** use `/` in alias names | ❌ Invalid |\n| Macro/Command chains are not supported | ❌ Unavailable |\n| Always use `/` in the command field for plugin commands | ✅ Required |\n| You can't create an alias named `create` | ❌ Reserved |\n| You can't point an alias command to `/create` | ❌ Reserved |\n| Duplicate alias names overwrite existing entries | 🔁 Expected |\n| The macro must exist in-game | ✅ Required |\n| Macro content is managed inside FFXIV, not inside the plugin | ℹ️ Note |\n\n</div>\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> These rules help prevent command conflicts and invalid alias behavior.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"future-plans\"></a>\n<div align=\"center\">\n    \n### 🚀 Future Plans\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"15%\">\n      <h3>🏷️</h3>\n      <strong>Pré-Made Categories</strong>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"15%\">\n      <h3>⌨️</h3>\n      <strong>Auto-Complete</strong>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"15%\">\n      <h3>✨</h3>\n      <strong>UI Animations</strong>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"15%\">\n      <h3>📂</h3>\n      <strong>Folders Support</strong>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n![Planned](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Planned-fdcb6e?style=for-the-badge)\n\n</div>\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"author\"></a>\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n### 👩‍💻 Author\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"220\">   \n    <h3>Latency Bryer</h3>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/seventity7\">\n        <img src=\"https://github.com/seventity7.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" style=\"border-radius: 50%;\" alt=\"GitHub profile picture\" />\n      </a>\n      <br /><br />\n      <a href=\"https://discordapp.com/users/896449611168874507\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Contact%20Me-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" />\n      </a>\n      <br />\n      <a href=\"https://bryerpl.carrd.co/\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Website-bryerpl.carrd.co-00b894?style=for-the-badge&logo=google-chrome&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Website\" />\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/seventity7/CreateXIV/issues\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-Issues-181717?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Github Issues\" />\n      </a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n</div>\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> For issues, suggestions or direct contact, use GitHub issues tab or contact me on Discord.",
